{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18691","headline":"自衡阳移桂十余本植零陵所住精舍 · 柳宗元","name":"自衡阳移桂十余本植零陵所住精舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谪官去南裔，清湘绕灵岳。\n晨登蒹葭岸，霜景霁纷浊。\n离披得幽桂，芳本欣盈握。\n火耕困烟烬，薪采久摧剥。\n道旁且不愿，岑岭况悠邈。\n倾筐壅故壤，栖息期鸾鷟。\n路远清凉宫，一雨悟无学。\n南人始珍重，微我谁先觉。\n芳意不可传，丹心徒自渥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18691.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18691","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}